WEBVTT

00:12:29.237 --> 00:12:32.349
Stress gives us access to our hearts.

00:12:33.897 --> 00:12:37.556
The compassionate heart
that finds joy and meaning

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:39.094
in connecting with others,

00:12:39.118 --> 00:12:42.656
and yes, your pounding physical heart,

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:46.541
working so hard to give you
strength and energy.

00:12:47.945 --> 00:12:51.264
And when you choose to view
stress in this way,

00:12:51.288 --> 00:12:53.776
you're not just getting better at stress,

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:56.543
you're actually making
a pretty profound statement.

00:12:57.627 --> 00:13:02.636
You're saying that you can trust yourself
to handle life's challenges.